\code{\link{f_aov}}.

Outputs can be generated in multiple formats ("pdf", "word", "excel" and "rmd") as specified by \code{output_type}. If \code{output_type = "rmd"} is used it is advised to use it in a chunk with \{r, echo=FALSE, results='asis'\}.

